  <name>ERPObjects</name>
  <synonym>
    <key>en</key>
    <value>EM2 objects</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>fa</key>
    <value>اشیای EM2</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>it</key>
    <value>Oggetti УП2</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>pl</key>
    <value>Obiekty УП2</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>ru</key>
    <value>Объекты УП2</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>tr</key>
    <value>EM2 nesneleri</value>
  </synonym>
  <synonym>
    <key>vi</key>
    <value>Đối tượng UP2</value>
  </synonym>
  <explanation>
    <key>en</key>
    <value>Technological subsystem.



It includes objects which belong only to the EM2 configuration.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>fa</key>
    <value>زیرسیستم فناوری.



شامل اشیایی است که فقط به پیکربندی EM2 تعلق دارند.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>it</key>
    <value>Sottosistema tecnologico.



Include gli oggetti che appartengono solo alla configurazione УП2.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>pl</key>
    <value>Podsystem technologiczny.


 
Zawiera obiekty związane tylko z konfiguracją УП2.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>ru</key>
    <value>Технологическая подсистема.



Включает в себя объекты, относящиеся только к конфигурации УП2.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>tr</key>
    <value>Teknolojik alt sistem.



Sadece ERP2 konfigürasyonu ile ilgili nesneleri içerir.</value>
  </explanation>
  <explanation>
    <key>vi</key>
    <value>Phân hệ công nghệ.



Bao gồm các đối tượng chỉ liên quan đến cấu hình UP2.</value>
  </explanation>
